option-preset = Preset
option-preset-help = Sets all graphics at once.
option-render-distance = Render distance
option-render-distance-help = Farther = more memory and computing.
option-vertical-distance = Vertical distance
option-vertical-distance-help = Sections drawn above/below you.
option-render-scale = Render scale
option-render-scale-help = 3D resolution. Lower eases the graphics card.
option-fps-limit = Frame rate limit
option-fps-limit-help = Fewer frames = less heat and battery.
option-vsync = Vertical sync
option-vsync-help = Prevents tearing; may add delay.
option-fov = Field of view
option-fov-help = Viewing angle. No effect on performance.
option-ambient-occlusion = Ambient occlusion
option-ambient-occlusion-help = Shadows in corners. Low cost.
option-lighting = Lighting
option-lighting-help = Full: dark caves, torches (one background thread). Flat: everything lit, no cost.
lighting-full = Full
lighting-flat = Flat
option-smooth-lighting = Smooth lighting
option-smooth-lighting-help = Blends light from block to block instead of hard steps. Low cost (meshing).
option-brightness = Brightness
option-brightness-help = Lifts dark places (caves, night). No cost.
option-fog = Fog
option-fog-help = Fades the distance into the sky. No cost.
option-animated-textures = Animated textures
option-animated-textures-help = Moving water, lava, fire and portals, liquid ripples. Almost no cost.
option-texture-variants = Texture variants
option-texture-variants-help = Random variants (grass, stone…) and connected textures (glass, bookshelves). Variants cost nothing; connected glass draws a few more faces.
option-biome-blend = Biome blend
option-biome-blend-help = Blends grass, leaf and water colours across biome borders, in blocks (off: sharp borders). A few more faces near borders; changing it rebuilds the meshes.
option-stars = Stars
option-stars-help = Twinkling stars in the night sky. Almost no cost.
option-clouds = Clouds
option-clouds-help = Drifting pixel-art clouds. Simple: one flat layer, very light. Full: with volume, a little more work for the graphics card.
clouds-off = Off
clouds-flat = Simple
clouds-full = Full
option-mipmaps = Mipmaps
option-mipmaps-help = Calmer distant textures. A bit of memory.
option-anisotropy = Anisotropic filtering
option-anisotropy-help = Sharp distant floors, softened pixels. Medium cost.
option-vegetation = Vegetation
option-vegetation-help = Grass and flowers drawn. Reduced or off eases the graphics card.
vegetation-full = Full
vegetation-reduced = Reduced
vegetation-off = Off
option-particles = Particles
option-particles-help = Fragments of broken blocks, drips under ceilings, bubbles. Reduced: fewer of them; off: nothing computed or drawn.
particles-off = Off
particles-reduced = Reduced
particles-full = Full
option-mesh-threads = Meshing threads
option-mesh-threads-help = More = world shown faster, more CPU.
option-world-threads = Generation threads
option-world-threads-help = More = world created faster (next world).
option-language = Language
option-language-help = Language of the game's texts.
option-scale = Interface size
option-scale-help = Enlarges menus and HUD (auto: from the screen).
option-font = Font
option-font-help = "Readable": a plain font, easier to read.
option-color-filter = Colour-blind filter
option-color-filter-help = Makes confused colours distinguishable.
option-reduce-camera = Reduce camera effects
option-reduce-camera-help = No sprint zoom or view bobbing.
option-pause-in-menus = Pause in every menu
option-pause-in-menus-help = Otherwise only the pause menu stops the world.
option-block-name = Targeted block name
option-block-name-help = Shows the name of the targeted block at the top.
option-edit-hud = Arrange the HUD…
option-edit-hud-help = Move the crosshair, hotbar and block name.
option-mouse-sensitivity = Mouse sensitivity
option-mouse-sensitivity-help = Turning speed with the mouse.
option-stick-sensitivity = Stick sensitivity
option-stick-sensitivity-help = Turning speed with the right stick.
option-invert-y = Invert vertical axis
option-invert-y-help = Up and down swapped when looking.
option-dead-zone = Dead zone
option-dead-zone-help = Ignores small movements of worn sticks.
option-auto-jump = Auto jump
option-auto-jump-help = Jumps up one-block steps by itself.
option-step-up = Step up half blocks
option-step-up-help = Climbs slabs and stairs without jumping.
option-reset-keys = Default keys
option-reset-keys-help = Restores every original key.
option-check-updates = Check for updates
option-check-updates-help = One question to GitHub at launch, nothing sent.
option-autosave = Autosave
option-autosave-help = More often = less loss, more writing.
option-backups = Backups
option-backups-help = Copies kept per world (one each time it opens).
option-idle-unfocused = Slow down in background
option-idle-unfocused-help = 5 frames/s when the window is not active.

